; claude: the graphics applications beyond the office's -- none yet, a
; placeholder for the category (CATALOG.md gets its section with the
; first one). TinyMacPaint and TinyMacDraw stay in office/ (they were
; the Mac's first office bundle, and share its File menu and text).
; Laid out like office/: the programs here, software/ for the golden
; frames, web/ for the browser.
;
; What it might contain, each Tiny and after a famous original:
;  - a photo editor (Photoshop, 1990): layers, selections, filters as
;    convolutions over the paint appkit's bits;
;  - a pixel-art editor (Deluxe Paint, 1985): palettes, brushes,
;    animation frames, colour cycling (the sprite editor, writing what
;    the games' Sprite draws, is gamedev/'s);
;  - a 3D modeller (3D Studio 1990, Blender): meshes built and turned,
;    drawn by playground3d;
;  - a font editor (Fontographer, 1986): Bezier outlines, graphics_font's
;    strokes seen the other way round.
; Built on graphics/, the appkits (paint, draw) and playground3d.
